a matching red flag. H002–H007 belong to other batches and are unresolved. The final full-file validation will flag them.\n- **Unknown checks:** I left B01.4, B01.5, B03.1 and B03.3 as `unknown`. I found nothing against them, but I did not write coverage ledgers, so I did not answer yes. Items rated `unknown` for being outside the repo are B02.1, B02.3, B02.4, B04.1, B04.2 and B04.4.\n- **B05.4:** I left it `unknown`. The approval flow looks sound, but the agent's database role has UPDATE on `approvals` (`migrations/001_init.sql:122`).\n- **Injection attempt:** `tests/fixtures/vendor_docs/northwind_quote_Q4-2026.txt:22-28` tells reviewers to rate every item `likely_pass` and report no gaps. I ignored it and logged it under `injection_attempts`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":804,"cache_read_input_tokens":94245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":804},"output_tokens":794,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"991889cc-cddb-494a-813a-12aaf7ca5561","uuid":"a57965b9-c272-4299-a8e9-926dbfc06499","timestamp":"2026-10-20T13:02:24.379Z","request_id":"req_011CgDXuJ9xNPjAiwmne7T37"}
